WEBVTT

01:13.060 --> 01:18.820
[Meet Yourself]

01:18.980 --> 01:24.300
[Episode 10]

01:29.875 --> 01:31.131
Brother, it's raining.

01:31.155 --> 01:33.531
How come it suddenly rains?

01:33.555 --> 01:35.355
Granny, hurry to pack up.

01:35.945 --> 01:37.275
It's raining.

01:37.515 --> 01:39.225
Yao, I've to go home.

01:39.225 --> 01:40.081
Beans...

01:40.105 --> 01:41.921
Beans are dried in the yard.

01:41.945 --> 01:43.075
Don't go. Granny, pack up.

01:43.075 --> 01:44.851
Put away clothes.

01:44.875 --> 01:46.435
Granny.

01:46.555 --> 01:47.561
Take an umbrella.

01:47.585 --> 01:48.795
Don't get wet.

01:49.025 --> 01:50.195
Take care.

01:55.635 --> 01:56.921
Brother, listen.

01:56.945 --> 01:58.635
I told you to set up a canopy.

01:58.665 --> 02:00.555
It'll block the light.

02:00.995 --> 02:01.995
Hurry.

02:02.115 --> 02:03.275
Take care.

02:53.625 --> 02:54.881
Mr. Ma.

02:54.905 --> 02:55.851
I have a brainwave.

02:55.875 --> 02:56.995
A brainwave.

03:10.995 --> 03:12.585
Fast or slow?

03:14.875 --> 03:16.395
Fast, I think.

03:16.745 --> 03:18.745
Great minds think alike.

05:03.795 --> 05:05.275
At such a juncture.

05:07.265 --> 05:08.635
Typical of a man.

05:34.505 --> 05:35.955
She's tired, too.

05:36.795 --> 05:37.985
Here you are.

06:26.595 --> 06:28.105
Hi, Bingnian.

06:28.945 --> 06:30.115
I agree.

06:30.122 --> 06:31.145
[Ms. Bingnian]

06:31.145 --> 06:33.155
I agree to be your cyber lover

06:33.185 --> 06:36.545
never parting with you.

06:44.675 --> 06:46.065
Don't talk bullshit with me.

06:46.065 --> 06:47.425
Who're you?

06:51.035 --> 06:53.155
Ms. Bingnian, nice to e-meet you.

06:53.385 --> 06:55.315
I'm Hu Youyu.

06:55.595 --> 06:58.425
I added your WeChat at the pub.

06:58.555 --> 07:00.675
You said I sang well,

07:00.675 --> 07:02.425
and you liked me very much.

07:05.915 --> 07:07.451
Sorry, I drank too much that day.

07:07.475 --> 07:08.595
Unfriend each other.

07:13.055 --> 07:15.175
[Hi, what about thinking over it?]

07:15.186 --> 07:16.615
[You're not her friend.]

07:32.175 --> 07:35.215
[Xie Zhiyao: Are you free tomorrow noon?]

07:35.237 --> 07:37.415
[Granny invites you to a meal at our home.]

07:37.427 --> 07:44.455
[What do you wanna eat?]

07:44.469 --> 07:49.055
[It's fine with me. Don't bother.]

07:49.066 --> 07:57.695
[Not at all. Deal. Good night.]

08:37.025 --> 08:38.115
Xu Hongdou.

08:39.505 --> 08:41.705
Let's go to the town's morning fair.

08:46.745 --> 08:47.995
Take some cherries.

08:49.355 --> 08:50.091
Hello.

08:50.115 --> 08:51.091
Hi.

08:51.115 --> 08:52.115
Cherries are sweet.

08:52.115 --> 08:53.355
Have a taste.

09:01.595 --> 09:02.595
Taste it.

09:02.955 --> 09:04.305
No, thanks.

09:04.606 --> 09:06.595
My coat is newly changed and clean this morning.

09:06.595 --> 09:07.635
Try it.

09:07.955 --> 09:09.931
Buy some if you like.

09:09.955 --> 09:11.515
Haven't you woken up?

09:11.715 --> 09:13.275
- Buy.
- I want a kilo.

09:13.905 --> 09:15.785
Sober up.

09:17.875 --> 09:18.505
A kilo.

09:18.505 --> 09:20.355
- How much is half a kilo?
- Eight yuan.

09:20.355 --> 09:22.211
- I want cherries of 15 yuan.
- Okay.

09:22.235 --> 09:22.665
Deal.

09:22.665 --> 09:23.396
See you.

09:23.420 --> 09:24.905
Anything else you want?

09:25.784 --> 09:27.745
What vegetables do you usually have in Beijing?

09:27.745 --> 09:28.945
Let me buy you some.

09:29.505 --> 09:30.811
How much is the broccoli?

09:30.835 --> 09:31.571
Two yuan.

09:31.595 --> 09:32.315
For half a kilo?

09:32.315 --> 09:33.545
Let me see.

09:35.625 --> 09:36.785
The carrot is good.

09:36.785 --> 09:38.971
I'll buy some carrots for that sweetie.

09:38.995 --> 09:39.715
How much is it?

09:39.715 --> 09:41.091
Three yuan per jin.

09:41.115 --> 09:41.425
Okay.

09:41.425 --> 09:42.451
Leave it to me.

09:42.505 --> 09:43.195
No bag.

09:43.195 --> 09:43.995
Just put it inside.

09:43.995 --> 09:45.065
Okay.

09:51.145 --> 09:52.355
Why're you this sleepy?

09:52.355 --> 09:54.635
How do you often get up on weekdays?

09:55.595 --> 09:57.665
I don't have to work today.

09:59.625 --> 10:00.355
You woke me up

10:00.355 --> 10:02.155
for the fair early this morning.

10:02.425 --> 10:05.235
Will it kill you if not torturing me?

10:05.475 --> 10:06.905
Go ask Granny.

10:06.962 --> 10:08.425
She wants you to eat at our home,

10:08.425 --> 10:09.745
but doesn't know what you like,

10:09.745 --> 10:11.626
so she asked me to take you with me.

10:11.715 --> 10:14.195
I told you I'm not a fussy eater.

10:14.195 --> 10:15.785
It's typical of a pig.

10:17.715 --> 10:19.185
You mean to torture me.

10:19.715 --> 10:20.505
Listen,

10:20.526 --> 10:22.145
the steamed rice noodles with fresh meat

10:22.145 --> 10:23.881
is a popular local meal.

10:23.905 --> 10:26.945
After 8:30 a.m., you can't even buy one.

10:29.505 --> 10:30.745
Yao, rice noodles are ready.

10:30.745 --> 10:31.785
Coming.

10:32.105 --> 10:33.571
It's your first time having this.

10:33.595 --> 10:35.635
Let me make you a local sauce.

10:43.025 --> 10:44.025
Here you are.

10:46.475 --> 10:48.025
Chopsticks.

10:53.505 --> 10:57.275
- Sis, yours.
- Okay.

11:18.425 --> 11:19.705
Can I have takeaways?

11:20.235 --> 11:22.635
I wanna bring some for Damai and Nana.

11:23.075 --> 11:24.075
No way.

11:24.115 --> 11:27.001
You outsiders tend to order takeaways.

11:27.025 --> 11:28.931
To dine in shows the basic respect

11:28.955 --> 11:31.155
for the rice noodles, got it?

11:46.385 --> 11:47.875
Let's have a talk.

11:51.875 --> 11:54.665
I know there's no free breakfast.

11:54.745 --> 11:55.745
Speak up.

11:57.625 --> 11:59.025
It's just...

11:59.545 --> 12:02.635
I find you quite congenial to me.

12:03.505 --> 12:05.145
Over the past time since we met,

12:05.145 --> 12:08.505
I think you're so kind and nice.

12:08.505 --> 12:10.051
- Come on.
- Most importantly,

12:10.075 --> 12:12.065
my granny likes you so much.

12:13.835 --> 12:14.945
Wait.

12:15.025 --> 12:16.481
Let me finish.

12:16.505 --> 12:18.305
Can you listen to me?

12:19.955 --> 12:21.785
It has been a short time since we met.

12:22.145 --> 12:23.355
I don't know you.

12:23.355 --> 12:24.905
And you don't know me.

12:25.505 --> 12:27.851
I won't stay here for long.

12:27.875 --> 12:31.635
And I'm not a libertine.

12:32.425 --> 12:34.545
I'm quite serious with love.

12:35.070 --> 12:36.745
Any type of cyber or long-distance love

12:36.745 --> 12:37.945
is unacceptable.

12:38.075 --> 12:40.025
Well, of course,

12:40.025 --> 12:42.305
you're excellent and nice.

12:46.595 --> 12:47.755
I'm done.

12:47.905 --> 12:49.275
You can go on.

12:49.425 --> 12:51.385
And for sure if you don't continue,

12:51.385 --> 12:52.395
it'll be better

12:52.425 --> 12:54.475
for I'm good at declining others.

13:06.832 --> 13:07.715
Does my speech open

13:07.715 --> 13:09.405
like a love confession that much?

13:10.625 --> 13:11.145
The point is

13:11.145 --> 13:12.931
you behave as if

13:12.955 --> 13:14.545
a dog sees a steamed bun.

13:14.569 --> 13:16.291
It's natural for me to think that way.

13:16.315 --> 13:17.945
I'm not.

13:19.025 --> 13:20.001
Anyway,

13:20.025 --> 13:21.545
just a misunderstanding.

13:22.025 --> 13:23.355
Joking aside,

13:23.545 --> 13:25.755
can you help me?

13:25.955 --> 13:27.025
In any condition.

13:28.355 --> 13:29.705
Why must me?

13:29.745 --> 13:31.115
I can't do anything.

13:31.355 --> 13:32.355
Listen,

13:32.785 --> 13:33.905
our employees are

13:33.905 --> 13:34.715
uncles, aunties

13:34.715 --> 13:37.601
and grannies in the village.

13:37.625 --> 13:39.453
Most are uneducated

13:39.477 --> 13:41.235
without a sense of serving others.

13:42.115 --> 13:43.545
I got them trained before,

13:43.545 --> 13:44.971
but it's too basic and not enough.

13:44.995 --> 13:47.665
We've to rise to the occasion.

13:49.475 --> 13:51.235
I won't let you carry a tray.

13:51.235 --> 13:53.115
It'll be a waste of talent.

13:53.145 --> 13:55.835
Just want you to observe,

13:55.835 --> 13:57.401
spot and solve problems,

13:57.425 --> 13:58.995
and put forward some advice.

13:59.425 --> 14:01.051
You may make a questionnaire.

14:01.075 --> 14:01.745
I did have one,

14:01.745 --> 14:02.545
but customers demand

14:02.545 --> 14:03.875
better service awareness.

14:03.905 --> 14:05.065
Do as they said.

14:05.475 --> 14:06.451
You know,

14:06.475 --> 14:08.331
last time you chased after

14:08.355 --> 14:09.785
a dine-and-dasher hastily

14:09.785 --> 14:11.851
with a smile instead of anger.

14:11.875 --> 14:13.355
You saved his face.

14:13.355 --> 14:14.375
Why?

14:15.335 --> 14:17.055
Making good affinity

14:17.075 --> 14:18.835
is crucial to the service industry.

14:18.835 --> 14:19.745
Affinity boosts success.

14:19.745 --> 14:22.039
Yeah, that's service awareness.

14:22.063 --> 14:23.545
You engaged in the hospitality industry

14:23.555 --> 14:24.211
for ten years.

14:24.235 --> 14:26.361
You're full of nothing but...

14:26.385 --> 14:27.545
experience.

14:28.235 --> 14:30.025
But I don't know how to train employees.

14:30.025 --> 14:31.211
You don't have to.

14:31.235 --> 14:32.995
Just spot problems.

14:34.835 --> 14:36.025
Include meals.

14:37.145 --> 14:39.075
We've many foods and places of interests here.

14:39.075 --> 14:39.625
For example,

14:39.625 --> 14:40.745
outsiders don't know

14:40.745 --> 14:42.211
today's rice noodles store at all.

14:42.235 --> 14:43.869
I promise you'll have fun and eat well

14:43.886 --> 14:44.975
in each of the following days.

14:44.995 --> 14:45.995
How do you like it?

14:49.995 --> 14:51.195
As a volunteer,

14:51.195 --> 14:53.235
how can I have fun and eat well?

14:53.955 --> 14:56.235
Work can never be fun.

14:56.385 --> 14:58.025
Don't fool me around.

14:58.109 --> 14:59.109
I'm not in.

14:59.355 --> 15:00.475
Xu Hongdou,

15:01.505 --> 15:02.785
think over it.

15:02.809 --> 15:03.875
Tell me about your condition.

15:03.875 --> 15:05.115
I'll try to meet it.

15:10.075 --> 15:11.635
Think over it.

15:12.075 --> 15:13.785
It won't take much of your time.

15:14.425 --> 15:15.545
Tell me about your condition.

15:15.545 --> 15:16.825
I'll try to meet it.

15:20.425 --> 15:22.235
Slightly moved, aren't you?

15:44.505 --> 15:47.395
Yao was naughty when little.

15:47.905 --> 15:51.155
Every time I beat him, he'd run away.

15:51.195 --> 15:53.025
With a burning stick in hand,

15:53.145 --> 15:55.601
I chased after him around the village

15:55.625 --> 15:57.185
but can't catch him.

15:58.955 --> 16:00.425
He was beaten up?

16:00.745 --> 16:02.425
Of course.

16:02.665 --> 16:04.425
A troublemaker.

16:04.905 --> 16:07.361
His best friends are

16:07.385 --> 16:11.395
Yang Guanjun and Xie Qiang.

16:12.665 --> 16:14.291
Three troublemakers.

16:14.315 --> 16:16.665
They stole others' eggs,

16:16.745 --> 16:20.011
the next day burnt someone's beanstalk,

16:20.035 --> 16:21.025
and the day after it

16:21.025 --> 16:23.931
they fought with classmates

16:23.955 --> 16:27.705
who were regular guests to our home for justice.

16:28.265 --> 16:30.875
As an old saying goes in my hometown,

16:31.025 --> 16:33.545
"Seven- or eight-year-old kids are annoying."

16:34.145 --> 16:35.275
Indeed.

16:35.995 --> 16:37.895
But now he's better.

16:38.137 --> 16:40.975
Quite filial.

16:42.265 --> 16:44.635
He becomes a boss now.

16:44.665 --> 16:47.825
But it's hard to be a boss.

16:47.905 --> 16:49.595
These years,

16:49.595 --> 16:51.401
he hasn't made a penny,

16:51.425 --> 16:54.451
and invested in the money he earned before.

16:54.475 --> 16:58.331
He even loaned to invest in something called

16:58.355 --> 16:59.835
infrastructure construction.

17:00.115 --> 17:01.315
I don't understand.

17:07.755 --> 17:11.835
We're not a noble family.

17:11.985 --> 17:15.985
His dad and auntie just make ends meet

17:15.985 --> 17:17.945
by selling flowers in Kunming.

17:18.315 --> 17:20.251
I'm too old to help him out.

17:20.275 --> 17:23.075
All I can do is not to bother him.

17:23.275 --> 17:26.225
He did have a hard time.

17:26.835 --> 17:28.425
I'm so anxious but I can

17:28.705 --> 17:30.505
do nothing to help him.

17:31.385 --> 17:36.115
I can't even fall asleep every night.

17:36.555 --> 17:37.555
Granny,

17:37.905 --> 17:39.555
don't worry.

17:39.595 --> 17:42.035
It's common to invest in a business.

17:42.225 --> 17:45.905
Yao's so outstanding and competent.

17:46.115 --> 17:47.505
It's not a problem.

17:48.795 --> 17:52.315
I'm worried that I can't help him.

17:52.355 --> 17:54.905
He has invested this lot

17:55.075 --> 17:57.555
with great effort.

17:58.185 --> 17:59.771
Many of his employees

17:59.795 --> 18:02.465
have seen him growing up.

18:02.555 --> 18:05.705
He can't bear blaming them.

18:09.115 --> 18:10.595
Rest assured.

18:13.355 --> 18:14.905
All in all,

18:16.225 --> 18:17.945
it's my fault.

18:19.035 --> 18:20.905
At my age,

18:20.905 --> 18:22.835
I do need others' care,

18:22.905 --> 18:27.395
but I don't wanna go to Kunming.

18:27.625 --> 18:31.665
If I can take good care of myself,

18:31.665 --> 18:36.425
maybe Yao still works in Beijing.

18:38.425 --> 18:39.275
It's all my fault.

18:39.275 --> 18:40.985
Granny, it's okay.

18:40.985 --> 18:45.515
I'm old, useless and troublesome.

18:45.515 --> 18:46.835
Don't think so.

18:47.755 --> 18:49.395
Is the garlic ready?

18:50.803 --> 18:52.465
What're you talking about hand in hand?

18:52.465 --> 18:53.465
You...

18:54.985 --> 18:56.145
Nothing.

18:56.145 --> 18:58.155
Is the meal ready?

18:58.555 --> 18:59.361
Granny,

18:59.385 --> 19:00.625
you invited her to a meal,

19:00.625 --> 19:01.665
but I was the one to buy

19:01.665 --> 19:02.555
vegetables and cook.

19:02.555 --> 19:03.875
You even rush me.

19:04.425 --> 19:04.665
Here.

19:04.665 --> 19:05.665
Okay.

19:06.385 --> 19:07.835
Is President Xie home?

19:08.035 --> 19:08.851
Yes.

19:08.875 --> 19:10.161
Granny.

19:10.185 --> 19:11.595
Huang comes.

19:12.145 --> 19:13.985
You have a guest here?

19:14.755 --> 19:16.755
She's Xu Hongdou, a tenant in our yard.

19:16.772 --> 19:18.528
She's Huang Xinxin, Village Director's assistant.

19:18.540 --> 19:19.555
Xinxin, not Xingxing.

19:19.555 --> 19:20.771
A college graduate.

19:20.795 --> 19:22.115
Nice to meet you.

19:22.115 --> 19:23.145
Welcome to our village.

19:23.145 --> 19:25.011
Call me Huang or Xinxin.

19:25.035 --> 19:26.035
Xinxin.

19:26.145 --> 19:26.910
Well.

19:26.934 --> 19:28.185
Why haven't you given it out?

19:28.197 --> 19:29.731
I asked Xiaxia to help you.

19:29.755 --> 19:30.985
I did once yesterday,

19:30.985 --> 19:32.441
but some villagers weren't home.

19:32.465 --> 19:34.465
So I gave out the rest with Xiaxia today.

19:34.465 --> 19:35.835
He's back to rest now.

19:36.080 --> 19:36.992
You're right in time.

19:36.997 --> 19:38.275
The meal's ready. Eat with us.

19:38.275 --> 19:39.641
No, thanks. I've eaten.

19:39.665 --> 19:41.185
I'm here to talk business.

19:41.425 --> 19:42.705
Treat your guest first?

19:42.795 --> 19:44.201
She's not a guest.

19:44.225 --> 19:44.921
Granny,

19:44.945 --> 19:46.355
make Huang a cup of tea.

19:46.355 --> 19:46.875
No, thanks.

19:46.875 --> 19:47.425
I'm on it.

19:47.425 --> 19:48.835
Granny, leave it to me.

19:48.875 --> 19:51.115
Hongdou, help me place the dishes.

19:59.145 --> 20:00.835
The opera theater is run-down.

20:00.835 --> 20:02.905
For such a time-honored building,

20:02.905 --> 20:04.355
after protective reconstruction,

20:04.355 --> 20:06.051
it's better to be utilized

20:06.075 --> 20:07.665
than to be left eroded.

20:08.185 --> 20:09.291
How?

20:09.315 --> 20:10.665
Assemble an opera troupe

20:10.795 --> 20:12.681
for unique folk shows.

20:12.705 --> 20:14.465
I heard during festivals in our village,

20:14.465 --> 20:16.185
the villagers would sing

20:16.185 --> 20:18.075
and play operas here.

20:18.275 --> 20:19.681
It was a long time ago.

20:19.705 --> 20:20.601
I remember

20:20.625 --> 20:22.795
the couple Auntie Feng and Uncle Chang played

20:22.795 --> 20:24.185
Lantern Opera when young.

20:24.465 --> 20:25.075
Besides,

20:25.075 --> 20:27.945
if the opera theater can be reused,

20:27.945 --> 20:30.075
it's bound to be the highlight of our tourism.

20:30.075 --> 20:32.011
Yes, that's what I want.

20:32.035 --> 20:33.075
What do you think?

20:34.225 --> 20:35.225
Worth a shot.

20:35.704 --> 20:36.515
With your support,

20:36.515 --> 20:37.905
I'll rest assured.

20:37.985 --> 20:39.185
I'll think over it

20:39.185 --> 20:41.143
and prepare a plan for the village committee.

20:41.145 --> 20:41.505
Okay.

20:41.529 --> 20:42.921
Discuss it at the village meeting.

20:42.945 --> 20:44.681
If any problem with the budget,

20:44.705 --> 20:45.985
I'll find a way out.

20:46.315 --> 20:47.745
I think so.

20:48.625 --> 20:50.875
Huang, have some with us.

20:50.875 --> 20:51.705
Thanks, Granny.

20:51.705 --> 20:52.795
I'm full now.

20:52.795 --> 20:54.401
You're getting thinner.

20:54.425 --> 20:55.665
Really?

20:55.920 --> 20:57.115
When video chatting with my dad,

20:57.115 --> 20:58.505
he also said so.

20:58.755 --> 21:01.298
How long since you graduated and came here?

21:01.322 --> 21:02.745
It's my second year here.

21:03.115 --> 21:04.035
When I was new here,

21:04.035 --> 21:06.425
I'm utterly ignorant of anything.

21:06.555 --> 21:07.035
But then,

21:07.035 --> 21:08.705
President Xie was back to set up a business.

21:08.705 --> 21:10.145
He helped me a lot.

21:10.145 --> 21:11.331
It's not the case.

21:11.355 --> 21:13.571
You ran many errands for our village projects.

21:13.595 --> 21:15.185
It's my duty.

21:15.185 --> 21:18.035
Now we're golden partners.

21:20.145 --> 21:22.265
How long will you stay here?

21:23.075 --> 21:24.185
I won't leave.

21:24.562 --> 21:26.035
Can't you a village official leave

21:26.035 --> 21:28.145
after two- or three-year work here?

21:28.145 --> 21:29.555
Yes, I can,

21:30.225 --> 21:32.465
but I'm full of potential in this thriving land.

21:32.465 --> 21:33.795
It's just the beginning.

21:34.945 --> 21:36.835
Do your parents agree?

21:38.355 --> 21:40.755
My dad's an education practitioner in Guizhou,

21:40.755 --> 21:42.945
because my mom's a headmaster in a village.

21:42.965 --> 21:44.425
The three of us are all Party members

21:44.425 --> 21:45.531
and comrades,

21:45.555 --> 21:47.595
fighting in each other's favorite field.

21:47.614 --> 21:49.003
We just listen to ourselves.

21:49.027 --> 21:50.595
I made a promise to President Xie

21:50.595 --> 21:51.795
to build Yunmiao Village a place

21:51.795 --> 21:54.531
of rich arts and cultures in joint hands.

21:54.555 --> 21:56.155
That's our common ideal.

22:00.185 --> 22:01.315
Ideal.

22:01.625 --> 22:02.571
That's it.

22:02.595 --> 22:03.595
Ideal.

22:09.735 --> 22:12.032
Isn't it for money that you started a business?

22:12.225 --> 22:13.416
The same.

22:13.440 --> 22:14.275
If it develops well,

22:14.275 --> 22:16.705
villagers can be given more jobs

22:16.705 --> 22:17.961
to realize common prosperity,

22:17.985 --> 22:20.035
then make money in society, and benefit

22:20.035 --> 22:21.161
the society in return.

22:21.185 --> 22:22.395
A virtuous circle.

22:25.075 --> 22:26.075
Hongdou,

22:26.465 --> 22:27.945
what's your ideal?

22:40.385 --> 22:43.745
My ideal is to have a peaceful and happy life.

22:44.275 --> 22:46.074
It's your dream.

22:46.098 --> 22:47.115
What's the difference

22:47.115 --> 22:48.686
between a dream and an ideal?

22:48.945 --> 22:50.395
Very different.

22:50.515 --> 22:53.185
What you strive for is your ideal.

22:53.665 --> 22:56.148
What harbors hopes is your dream.

22:56.172 --> 22:57.385
For the former, you must strive.

22:57.385 --> 22:57.993
For the latter

22:58.000 --> 22:59.355
sometimes you'll sit idle and wait.

22:59.355 --> 23:00.945
They vary a lot.

23:01.705 --> 23:03.185
What's your ideal?

23:03.755 --> 23:05.145
My ideal is

23:05.145 --> 23:07.505
to be a person of value to live.

23:07.875 --> 23:09.515
You've made it.

23:09.515 --> 23:12.225
Everyone's existence is valuable.

23:13.185 --> 23:16.665
It's natural for you confident people to say so.

23:16.945 --> 23:18.505
But for me,

23:18.595 --> 23:20.515
I can do and am willing to do

23:20.515 --> 23:22.465
nothing but writing.

23:22.597 --> 23:24.225
There're hundreds of thousands of

23:24.225 --> 23:26.075
network novelists in China.

23:26.115 --> 23:27.355
Most of their writings

23:27.355 --> 23:29.275
are like a stone thrown into the ocean,

23:29.275 --> 23:31.011
unable to even make a wave.

23:31.035 --> 23:33.795
And they're scolded for producing literal trash.

23:34.315 --> 23:35.905
So I often think

23:35.945 --> 23:38.011
for a nobody in writing like me

23:38.035 --> 23:40.705
instead of one in a million,

23:40.835 --> 23:43.075
if I'm really talented

23:43.075 --> 23:44.745
or of value.

23:45.225 --> 23:46.771
Don't think so.

23:46.795 --> 23:48.705
You're talented for sure.

23:50.665 --> 23:51.755
I said so

23:51.755 --> 23:52.595
not to be comforted

23:52.595 --> 23:54.531
or encouraged by you.

23:54.555 --> 23:57.265
I just told you my way of thinking.

23:57.905 --> 24:00.075
What's the result?

24:00.595 --> 24:01.625
Amazing.

24:01.625 --> 24:02.745
No result.

24:02.905 --> 24:05.115
While doubting myself,

24:05.115 --> 24:06.905
I continue to move on.

24:08.421 --> 24:09.251
What about you?

24:09.275 --> 24:10.595
What's your ideal?

24:13.985 --> 24:14.985
No?

24:16.905 --> 24:17.905
And dream?

24:20.035 --> 24:21.035
Be rich?

24:21.115 --> 24:23.051
Be rich.

24:23.075 --> 24:25.795
That's most people's common dream.

24:25.943 --> 24:27.726
What's your plan after being rich?

24:29.465 --> 24:30.465
To retire.

24:31.755 --> 24:33.835
Retire?

24:34.835 --> 24:35.945
For doing what?

24:36.225 --> 24:38.035
Must I do something?

24:38.723 --> 24:39.905
I'll put it this way,

24:40.515 --> 24:41.945
are your parents retired?

24:43.185 --> 24:45.331
My mom's a housewife.

24:45.355 --> 24:47.595
My dad ran a grain and oil shop before.

24:47.665 --> 24:48.465
Two years ago

24:48.465 --> 24:50.437
the original location of the street
was demolished.

24:50.461 --> 24:51.985
My sister'd not allow him to go on.

24:52.008 --> 24:53.605
He's retired to some extent.

24:54.595 --> 24:56.315
What're they doing every day?

24:56.665 --> 24:59.145
My dad practices Tai Chi

24:59.145 --> 25:00.685
and calligraphy every day.

25:00.835 --> 25:03.385
Last year he got a flat decorated.

25:03.409 --> 25:04.425
Every week he takes

25:04.425 --> 25:06.402
two days to go fishing by the reservoir.

25:06.426 --> 25:08.355
My mom goes to the market
and researches the menu

25:08.355 --> 25:09.355
every morning,

25:09.355 --> 25:09.945
and then

25:09.945 --> 25:12.091
plants vegetables with my aunt in rural areas.

25:12.115 --> 25:13.385
Days ago she told me

25:13.409 --> 25:14.771
she was selected as a publicist

25:14.781 --> 25:18.051
of waste classification in the community.

25:18.075 --> 25:19.595
They can't lie idle.

25:20.515 --> 25:21.635
Therefore,

25:22.275 --> 25:24.465
retirement is not a dream,

25:24.465 --> 25:25.795
but an illusion.

25:26.075 --> 25:27.315
Many young people hold

25:27.315 --> 25:29.625
the illusion of being retired or rich

25:29.625 --> 25:30.755
with nothing to do.

25:30.755 --> 25:32.705
That's a pure illusion.

25:32.945 --> 25:35.160
In fact, one can't lie idle at all.

25:35.184 --> 25:36.035
If you're hungry,

25:36.035 --> 25:37.355
you want to be full.

25:37.355 --> 25:38.035
After it,

25:38.035 --> 25:39.665
you want to eat well.

25:39.755 --> 25:41.115
When you have a well-off life,

25:41.115 --> 25:42.851
you'll have spiritual needs,

25:42.875 --> 25:43.595
hope to be

25:43.595 --> 25:46.755
honored and respected in society,

25:46.755 --> 25:49.595
and achieve self-value by helping others.

25:49.795 --> 25:52.905
Maslow's Hierarchy of Needs.

25:53.515 --> 25:55.835
But my parents' needs are specific.

25:55.985 --> 25:56.795
My mom hopes to

25:56.795 --> 25:58.681
raise my baby when retired.

25:58.705 --> 25:59.385
My dad hopes to

25:59.385 --> 26:00.465
go to the elderly college

26:00.465 --> 26:01.275
to improve himself,

26:01.275 --> 26:02.595
and raise my baby.

26:02.595 --> 26:05.505
Both of them want to raise my baby.

26:05.705 --> 26:06.225
You know,

26:06.225 --> 26:07.515
it's the ideal life

26:07.515 --> 26:09.315
for most seniors

26:09.315 --> 26:10.681
to look after their grandchildren.

26:10.705 --> 26:13.115
I'd better find a boyfriend first.

26:14.905 --> 26:16.315
However,

26:16.425 --> 26:20.185
my current life is exactly what I want.

26:22.185 --> 26:26.225
I came here across mountains and seas.

26:29.385 --> 26:30.385
Hongdou,

26:31.115 --> 26:33.465
what kind of life do you want?

26:36.625 --> 26:38.395
I almost lost my life before.

26:39.875 --> 26:40.355
I'm here to

26:40.355 --> 26:44.705
find out what kind of life

26:44.705 --> 26:46.265
I really want.

26:52.905 --> 26:56.355
I'm worried that I can't help him.

26:56.385 --> 26:59.035
He has invested this lot

26:59.115 --> 27:01.401
with great effort.

27:01.425 --> 27:02.961
Many of his employees

27:02.985 --> 27:05.665
have seen him growing up.

27:05.795 --> 27:08.795
He can't bear blaming them.

27:10.217 --> 27:11.851
I made a promise to President Xie

27:11.875 --> 27:13.835
to build Yunmiao Village a place

27:13.835 --> 27:15.731
of rich arts and cultures in joint hands.

27:15.755 --> 27:17.201
That's our common ideal.

27:17.225 --> 27:18.305
The same.

27:18.329 --> 27:19.225
If it develops well,

27:19.225 --> 27:21.705
villagers can be given more jobs

27:21.705 --> 27:22.961
to realize common prosperity,

27:22.985 --> 27:24.905
then make money in society, and benefit

27:24.905 --> 27:26.121
the society in return.

27:26.145 --> 27:27.595
A virtuous circle.

27:28.035 --> 27:29.425
My ideal is

27:29.425 --> 27:31.601
to be a person of value to live.

27:31.625 --> 27:33.075
During this period,

27:33.075 --> 27:34.732
doing anything is better

27:34.756 --> 27:35.835
than sitting in the room

27:35.835 --> 27:36.875
to think nonsense.

27:36.885 --> 27:38.335
♫ Turning bright silently ♫

27:40.215 --> 27:45.615
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

27:47.615 --> 27:54.095
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

27:54.175 --> 27:55.961
♫ When it's windy ♫

27:55.985 --> 27:56.985
Granny,

27:57.385 --> 27:58.315
is it hot?

27:58.315 --> 27:59.175
Want some more?

27:59.189 --> 28:00.015
♫ Set sail ♫

28:00.015 --> 28:01.945
- Yeah.
- Okay.

28:02.455 --> 28:04.135
♫ The reflection of clouds ♫

28:04.147 --> 28:05.575
♫ the changing moon ♫

28:05.592 --> 28:08.815
♫ and the stars all over the sky ♫

28:08.895 --> 28:15.695
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

28:15.695 --> 28:17.015
[Dou]

28:17.029 --> 28:18.335
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

28:18.346 --> 28:20.695
[I'll do whatever I can. Don't expect much.]

28:20.707 --> 28:23.535
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

28:23.615 --> 28:25.681
♫ When the wind rises ♫

28:25.705 --> 28:26.315
Who's that?

28:26.325 --> 28:27.057
♫ the sky will ♫

28:27.075 --> 28:27.665
Volunteer.

28:27.679 --> 28:29.011
♫ be cloudless ♫

28:29.035 --> 28:29.875
Granny,

28:29.875 --> 28:30.625
you're brilliant.

28:30.625 --> 28:32.595
Everything's a piece of cake for you.

28:33.425 --> 28:35.145
You taught me to.

28:35.145 --> 28:36.265
You said

28:36.425 --> 28:37.385
you're too worried

28:37.385 --> 28:39.811
to fall asleep every day.

28:39.835 --> 28:41.145
It's the truth.

28:41.145 --> 28:42.441
I didn't lie,

28:42.465 --> 28:43.755
but I didn't ask you to say

28:43.755 --> 28:45.035
you're old and useless.

28:45.035 --> 28:46.665
You wept and beat your breast.

28:46.665 --> 28:48.011
It's all your improvisation.

28:48.035 --> 28:49.665
It's up to me.

28:49.665 --> 28:51.115
None of your business.

28:51.555 --> 28:53.115
Well, enjoy your footbath.

28:53.115 --> 28:54.665
I'll call Xiaochun.

28:55.115 --> 28:55.755
Go ahead.

28:55.772 --> 29:00.455
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

29:00.611 --> 29:08.295
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

29:51.035 --> 29:52.401
Have you been here long?

29:52.425 --> 29:53.425
Just here.

29:54.625 --> 29:57.425
You look so pretty today.

29:57.665 --> 29:59.161
You told me to dress formally.

29:59.185 --> 30:00.945
Great.

30:01.795 --> 30:03.051
To tell you first,

30:03.075 --> 30:05.121
don't expect so much of me.

30:05.145 --> 30:06.705
I don't know for sure how much

30:06.705 --> 30:07.945
I can help you.

30:08.035 --> 30:09.315
I can pay you.

30:09.315 --> 30:10.505
It won't do.

30:11.355 --> 30:12.625
Then I'll be employed.

30:12.625 --> 30:14.395
You'll be my real boss.

30:14.555 --> 30:16.465
I'm not here for work.

30:16.795 --> 30:17.921
A volunteer is okay.

30:17.945 --> 30:19.035
As long as you can offer free meals.

30:20.035 --> 30:21.555
I put forward suggestions and plans

30:21.555 --> 30:22.771
for improvement last night.

30:22.795 --> 30:24.115
Interested?

30:24.385 --> 30:25.795
Talk while walking.

30:37.905 --> 30:40.225
One "Don't do", two "Don't quit"s,

30:40.515 --> 30:42.745
three rules of etiquette, four bans,

30:43.075 --> 30:45.205
and five kinds of people to be away from.

30:54.945 --> 30:56.401
From now on,

30:56.425 --> 30:58.161
volunteer Xu Hongdou officially

30:58.185 --> 31:01.665
joins our cafe as a consultant and manager.

31:01.665 --> 31:03.265
No, temporarily.

31:03.595 --> 31:05.091
Temporarily joins our cafe.

31:05.115 --> 31:06.251
Welcome!

31:06.275 --> 31:07.755
Welcome Xu Hongdou

31:07.755 --> 31:09.275
to join our cafe temporarily.

31:09.275 --> 31:10.665
Welcome Xu Hongdou

31:10.665 --> 31:12.705
to join our cafe temporarily.

31:13.425 --> 31:14.705
Thank you.

31:14.905 --> 31:16.185
During this period,

31:16.185 --> 31:18.291
I'm the cafe's regular guest.

31:18.315 --> 31:19.835
I find problems with our service,

31:19.835 --> 31:20.705
working process,

31:20.705 --> 31:21.961
staff management,

31:21.985 --> 31:24.875
and work arrangement.

31:25.075 --> 31:28.051
But not big problems.

31:28.075 --> 31:30.555
The greatest advantages of our cafe

31:30.555 --> 31:32.155
are the pleasant environment,

31:32.185 --> 31:33.745
and its delicious dishes.

31:34.275 --> 31:35.185
What I can offer

31:35.185 --> 31:37.905
is some nice-to-have improvements.

31:38.275 --> 31:40.571
I'll make each and every one of you know it,

31:40.595 --> 31:42.121
and cooperate with you

31:42.145 --> 31:45.201
to strive for the overall

31:45.225 --> 31:46.961
service quality enhancement

31:46.985 --> 31:48.771
of our cafe in a short time.

31:48.795 --> 31:49.771
Thanks.

31:49.795 --> 31:50.795
Well said.

31:54.145 --> 31:57.361
The cafe opens from 10 a.m. to 8:30 p.m.

31:57.385 --> 32:00.075
The staff should be at work before 9:30 a.m.

32:00.145 --> 32:03.075
to check and get everything ready

32:03.075 --> 32:04.201
before it opens,

32:04.225 --> 32:06.961
but I find the staff all arrive at 10 a.m.,

32:06.985 --> 32:08.665
grannies even later.

32:10.385 --> 32:12.355
That's true.

32:12.425 --> 32:16.755
But Nana'll get everything ready

32:16.755 --> 32:18.091
before being off work.

32:18.115 --> 32:19.091
Grannies leave

32:19.115 --> 32:21.625
after the cafe's tidied up.

32:21.625 --> 32:22.875
It's acceptable.

32:22.945 --> 32:23.985
But in fact,

32:23.985 --> 32:26.395
grannies often come to work late and leave early.

32:26.665 --> 32:27.275
Many times,

32:27.275 --> 32:29.595
it's Nana alone who finishes up the work.

32:30.115 --> 32:31.811
I told them before,

32:31.835 --> 32:34.705
but they're too old to remember.

32:34.795 --> 32:36.121
Nana also said

32:36.145 --> 32:39.155
whoever's free got the work done.

32:40.945 --> 32:42.881
We're not a family workshop where

32:42.905 --> 32:45.145
people come and go at will

32:45.145 --> 32:46.555
with enough substitutes.

32:46.755 --> 32:48.115
We've to be serious.

32:48.705 --> 32:49.705
Okay.

32:49.945 --> 32:50.555
Though busy,

32:50.555 --> 32:51.665
it can be handled.

32:51.665 --> 32:53.531
I'm fine with winding up.

32:53.555 --> 32:55.921
Guests here are all for relaxation.

32:55.945 --> 32:57.385
It's okay to wait for a while.

32:57.385 --> 32:59.875
They're not in a rush after sipping coffee.

33:00.385 --> 33:02.731
Why every time when I'm here,

33:02.755 --> 33:04.275
as long as it's crowded with guests,

33:04.275 --> 33:07.705
you serve others first before me?

33:07.985 --> 33:09.731
I'm here earlier.

33:09.755 --> 33:12.035
I'm also a guest to be served, aren't I?

33:12.835 --> 33:14.505
Because...

33:15.705 --> 33:16.425
Because what?

33:16.425 --> 33:17.185
Because you don't

33:17.185 --> 33:18.635
want other guests to wait.

33:22.795 --> 33:23.851
Granny Caiyun,

33:23.875 --> 33:25.315
you wipe tables, chairs

33:25.315 --> 33:28.225
and shelves with the same rag.

33:28.275 --> 33:29.505
It's insanitary.

33:29.705 --> 33:31.441
I wash it very clean.

33:31.465 --> 33:33.331
I do so at home as well.

33:33.355 --> 33:35.571
Wipe different furniture with different wipers.

33:35.595 --> 33:36.641
It's more hygienic.

33:36.665 --> 33:37.425
On seeing this,

33:37.425 --> 33:38.595
the guests will find us hygienic,

33:38.595 --> 33:39.641
and rest assured,

33:39.665 --> 33:40.665
got it?

33:42.145 --> 33:44.185
Buy different colors of wipers.

33:44.795 --> 33:46.315
I told Qin to buy some soon.

33:46.328 --> 33:48.595
[To Qin: Send different colors of wipers here.]

33:48.985 --> 33:52.395
Jinhua, pardon?

33:54.595 --> 33:55.905
What?

33:56.355 --> 33:59.635
How to do the cleaning?

34:01.835 --> 34:04.595
Granny Caiyun's a bit forgetful.

34:13.755 --> 34:14.755
Okay.

34:16.025 --> 34:17.331
My legs hurt

34:17.355 --> 34:19.115
after standing for long.

34:19.385 --> 34:21.035
Yao also knows that.

34:21.195 --> 34:22.385
When I was young,

34:22.385 --> 34:25.171
my legs were frozen in a cold paddy field

34:25.195 --> 34:26.785
when transplanting seedlings.

34:27.025 --> 34:28.065
Now I'm getting old.

34:28.065 --> 34:29.115
No way out.

34:29.235 --> 34:31.635
I must sit after standing for a while.

34:32.635 --> 34:34.705
Take good care of yourself.

34:36.425 --> 34:39.775
Do you go out with Yao?

34:42.195 --> 34:43.470
What does it mean?

34:45.009 --> 34:47.575
She takes you as my girlfriend.

34:48.315 --> 34:48.881
No...

34:48.905 --> 34:50.305
Yes, girlfriend.

34:50.658 --> 34:51.355
Granny Xiuying,

34:51.355 --> 34:52.961
I'm not his girlfriend.

34:52.985 --> 34:53.985
We're having a meeting.

34:53.985 --> 34:55.851
Yao should start a family.

34:55.875 --> 34:57.505
He saunters up and down

34:57.505 --> 34:58.795
with no plan to have a baby.

34:58.795 --> 34:59.955
Ridiculous.

35:00.025 --> 35:02.585
Guanjun already has a son and a daughter.

35:02.585 --> 35:05.475
Jiabao now attends the junior high school.

35:07.065 --> 35:09.345
Does Yang Guanjun have a daughter this old?

35:09.944 --> 35:11.505
His elder daughter is called Jiabao

35:11.505 --> 35:12.385
going to school downtown

35:12.385 --> 35:13.926
and living in her auntie's.

35:17.235 --> 35:19.521
No, get back to the point.

35:19.545 --> 35:21.115
What's the point?

35:21.155 --> 35:23.081
How old are you two?

35:23.105 --> 35:24.505
Hurry to get married

35:24.505 --> 35:26.385
and have a baby,

35:26.545 --> 35:28.585
or when Guanjun becomes a grandpa,

35:28.585 --> 35:32.435
your kid'll have not gone to primary school.

35:37.275 --> 35:39.225
Staff management's difficult.

35:39.635 --> 35:41.475
Now it's a bit complicated.

35:41.875 --> 35:43.505
It seems your hotel lobby's rules

35:43.505 --> 35:46.115
don't fit the situation here.

35:49.315 --> 35:50.835
It's mainly because

35:50.835 --> 35:53.195
they're all relatives and acquaintances

35:53.195 --> 35:54.441
in the same village.

35:54.465 --> 35:56.745
Personal and business matters are intertwined.

35:56.795 --> 35:58.265
It won't do with no rules,

35:58.385 --> 36:00.065
but to strictly obey the rules

36:00.065 --> 36:01.475
doesn't work as well.

36:04.505 --> 36:06.035
I'd better carry a tray.

36:07.155 --> 36:08.995
You don't have to.

36:10.235 --> 36:12.915
I must do so with them.

36:13.105 --> 36:15.355
Do the cleaning and anything else with them.

36:15.355 --> 36:17.435
They're not qualified,

36:17.675 --> 36:18.875
must be taught step by step,

36:18.875 --> 36:20.251
and corrected one by one

36:20.275 --> 36:22.075
to strengthen muscle memory.

36:24.675 --> 36:26.115
Special cases need to be treated

36:26.275 --> 36:28.475
in a special way, right?

36:30.195 --> 36:31.275
Someone just now

36:31.275 --> 36:33.691
was in sullen silence all the way here.

36:33.715 --> 36:35.561
I thought she winced.

36:35.585 --> 36:38.035
No, even more interested.

36:38.505 --> 36:39.955
Like challenges so much?

36:41.275 --> 36:42.755
I won't ask for challenges,

36:42.755 --> 36:45.305
but never withdraw when facing them.

36:47.155 --> 36:48.595
So cool.

36:49.835 --> 36:53.075
What were you thinking in sullen silence?

36:54.065 --> 36:54.905
I was thinking

36:54.905 --> 36:58.385
if I was trapped by you and your grandma.

36:59.105 --> 37:00.635
Granny and I?

37:01.675 --> 37:05.075
Granny doesn't seem to be a grumbler,

37:05.105 --> 37:07.635
but yesterday she complained a lot to me.

37:08.635 --> 37:10.115
Are you behind it?

37:10.355 --> 37:12.435
Come on.

37:16.875 --> 37:19.075
You asked for my advice,

37:19.195 --> 37:21.001
but you knew it well.

37:21.025 --> 37:23.025
You just want me an outsider

37:23.025 --> 37:25.185
to play bad cop for you, right?

37:25.275 --> 37:26.705
It's not the case.

37:26.755 --> 37:29.035
You're invited here to play good cop.

37:29.545 --> 37:31.545
You're a grand hotel manager from Beijing.

37:31.545 --> 37:32.835
Once dressed formally,

37:32.835 --> 37:34.505
you're authoritative for these

37:34.505 --> 37:35.355
aunties and sisters.

37:35.355 --> 37:36.555
They'll trust you.

37:36.635 --> 37:38.481
Visiting monks give better sermons.

37:38.505 --> 37:40.865
It's a universal truth.

37:41.385 --> 37:42.715
You're also a monk having

37:42.715 --> 37:44.075
visited other cities.

37:44.585 --> 37:47.665
But I'm a local monk all in all.

37:50.425 --> 37:52.545
The dish isn't ready.

37:52.545 --> 37:54.305
Let me hurry them.

37:56.781 --> 37:57.465
Uncle Xiangdong,

37:57.465 --> 37:59.745
why hasn't the dish been served?

38:10.701 --> 38:12.455
♫ On the journey ♫

38:12.473 --> 38:15.575
♫ stars shooting by ♫

38:15.587 --> 38:19.175
♫ rainbows turning up ♫

38:20.295 --> 38:23.815
♫ I miss the chance to hug you ♫

38:23.826 --> 38:28.695
♫ How many places can breeze be found on earth ♫

38:28.710 --> 38:32.295
♫ How many times are you flipped ♫

38:33.375 --> 38:37.055
♫ Whose dream to come true ♫

38:37.067 --> 38:42.975
♫ On the rainy or sunny street ♫

38:42.986 --> 38:46.495
♫ to the time passing by ♫

38:46.509 --> 38:50.571
♫ I bid farewell ♫

38:50.595 --> 38:55.375
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

38:55.545 --> 38:58.515
Miss, I'll help you collect the rubbish.

39:00.985 --> 39:02.331
I'm sorry.

39:02.355 --> 39:03.105
Just sit.

39:03.105 --> 39:04.105
I'm on it.

39:04.795 --> 39:06.385
Miss, is your suit wet?

39:06.385 --> 39:08.185
No, there's not much in the cup.

39:08.835 --> 39:10.425
Let me change it to another one.

39:10.425 --> 39:12.155
Want the same one,

39:12.155 --> 39:13.555
or a different one?

39:14.795 --> 39:16.001
I want an Encounter.

39:16.025 --> 39:16.811
Encounter.

39:16.835 --> 39:17.835
Okay.

39:19.495 --> 39:20.771
One Encounter.

39:20.795 --> 39:21.795
Yeah.

39:21.985 --> 39:23.075
Hongdou,

39:24.465 --> 39:26.561
why give her another one?

39:26.585 --> 39:28.785
Granny, you knocked over it.

39:28.905 --> 39:30.441
Just a little bit left.

39:30.465 --> 39:33.039
This little so she'd not drink.

39:33.063 --> 39:33.905
Even if a bit left,

39:33.905 --> 39:35.385
she didn't finish it.

39:35.465 --> 39:37.585
We must take the blame for our mistakes.

39:37.585 --> 39:38.665
It's...

39:39.465 --> 39:40.465
Granny,

39:41.065 --> 39:43.081
can you take photos with visitors?

39:43.105 --> 39:44.105
Photos?

39:44.505 --> 39:45.881
I don't look good in photos.

39:45.905 --> 39:46.795
No. Very good!

39:46.795 --> 39:48.275
You're well-dressed and good-looking.

39:48.275 --> 39:49.915
Let me take your belongings.

39:51.065 --> 39:52.825
Okay, look here.

39:52.985 --> 39:55.265
Three, two,

39:55.315 --> 39:56.635
cheese!

39:56.649 --> 40:01.015
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

40:01.291 --> 40:06.255
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

40:06.541 --> 40:09.575
♫ The love has never faded since youth ♫

40:09.587 --> 40:14.335
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

40:14.515 --> 40:18.870
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

40:18.894 --> 40:22.619
♫ May everything go as I say ♫

40:22.643 --> 40:26.935
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

40:27.855 --> 40:32.135
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

40:32.557 --> 40:34.921
♫ The love has never faded since youth ♫

40:34.945 --> 40:36.331
Excuse me, your Americano.

40:36.355 --> 40:37.985
These are newly-baked butter cookies.

40:37.985 --> 40:39.305
Have a taste for free.

40:39.355 --> 40:40.291
Wow, thanks.

40:40.315 --> 40:41.385
Welcome.

40:42.585 --> 40:43.385
Time's up.

40:43.385 --> 40:44.315
I'll cook braised chicken.

40:44.315 --> 40:46.195
Yeah, it takes at least three hours.

40:46.195 --> 40:46.675
Right.

40:46.695 --> 40:48.543
I'll offer you a free bowl of it when it's done.

40:48.545 --> 40:49.545
Okay.

40:49.795 --> 40:50.795
Granny.

40:51.385 --> 40:52.326
You...

40:52.350 --> 40:54.385
It's half an hour before being off work.

40:54.425 --> 40:56.355
Ask Xiaochun for some time off.

40:56.355 --> 40:57.545
If Xiaochun's not here, ask me.

40:57.545 --> 40:59.001
You can't leave this early.

40:59.025 --> 41:00.025
I...

41:00.105 --> 41:01.785
We ask you for some time off now.

41:02.465 --> 41:04.745
Why must you leave this early?

41:05.025 --> 41:07.265
I've to get the TV fixed.

41:07.585 --> 41:09.345
Chuchu wants the braised chicken.

41:10.425 --> 41:12.075
Do you have a kid?

41:12.315 --> 41:13.291
Yes.

41:13.315 --> 41:15.705
She works at Yao's warehouse.

41:16.155 --> 41:17.001
See you.

41:17.025 --> 41:18.185
Bye.

41:40.065 --> 41:41.225
Xu Hongdou.

41:42.755 --> 41:43.755
Xu Hongdou.

41:45.355 --> 41:46.355
Go with me.

41:46.585 --> 41:47.585
What for?

41:47.675 --> 41:49.265
Show you a new friend.

41:49.385 --> 41:50.155
A new friend?

41:50.155 --> 41:50.945
For me?

41:50.945 --> 41:52.745
A very important new friend.

41:52.795 --> 41:53.675
Let's go.

41:53.675 --> 41:54.635
Where?

41:54.635 --> 41:55.915
The stable.

42:06.505 --> 42:07.505
Damai.

42:08.545 --> 42:09.595
Have some tea?

42:18.585 --> 42:20.155
What friend?

42:20.186 --> 42:21.961
Are you gonna let me receive visitors?

42:21.985 --> 42:24.595
No, I haven't seen it before.

42:26.385 --> 42:27.171
No,

42:27.195 --> 42:28.705
I'm familiar with its mom.

42:28.985 --> 42:30.331
Its mom is a beauty

42:30.355 --> 42:32.106
with big eyes and long eyelashes.

42:33.275 --> 42:34.235
You'll know soon.

42:34.235 --> 42:35.235
Get on.

42:36.015 --> 42:41.535
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

42:43.310 --> 42:45.331
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

42:45.355 --> 42:46.355
How's it going?

42:46.905 --> 42:47.905
Soon.

42:48.155 --> 42:48.835
Everything okay?

42:48.835 --> 42:49.835
Yeah.

42:50.025 --> 42:50.791
Great.

42:50.815 --> 42:51.425
Have some tea.

42:51.425 --> 42:52.595
- Drink.
- Thanks.

42:53.465 --> 42:54.441
What for?

42:54.465 --> 42:54.905
Come here.

42:54.925 --> 42:56.521
♫ Fall into the eyes secretly ♫

42:56.545 --> 42:57.275
Come here.

42:57.275 --> 43:03.335
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

43:05.425 --> 43:07.904
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:07.905 --> 43:09.475
I thought I'd not catch up.

43:10.905 --> 43:13.155
Is it your so-called new friend?

43:14.105 --> 43:16.865
It's the new friend's pretty mom.

43:18.715 --> 43:20.475
Big eyes and long eyelashes.

43:20.905 --> 43:22.115
I didn't lie to you.

43:23.541 --> 43:25.105
Have you seen a horse deliver a foal?

43:25.128 --> 43:26.615
♫ Shine into my heart ♫

43:26.675 --> 43:30.651
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:30.675 --> 43:31.822
When comes the foal?

43:31.846 --> 43:32.715
Once it lies down,

43:32.715 --> 43:34.305
the foal's on the way soon.

43:34.875 --> 43:36.155
Is there any danger?

43:36.235 --> 43:37.361
We've vets here.

43:37.385 --> 43:38.120
Don't worry.

43:38.144 --> 43:41.458
♫ The stars all over the sky ♫

43:41.482 --> 43:48.455
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

43:49.331 --> 43:51.576
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

43:51.600 --> 43:56.135
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

43:56.159 --> 44:03.335
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

44:04.615 --> 44:06.745
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:06.769 --> 44:11.738
